                                    <TextBlock Text="32종 동물 아바타 연동 책상 셔플" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BeigeTextMuted}" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- Tool 14: Classroom Soundboard -->
                            <Border Margin="6" Background="{DynamicResource BeigeCardBg}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BeigeCardBorder}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18" Cursor="Hand" MouseLeftButtonUp="BtnLaunchSoundboard_Click">
