                                    <TextBlock Text="지도 기반 위치·규모·학급수·과밀 분석" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource BeigeTextMuted}" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

